    <summary type="text">I&#39;ve been learning a lot just about basic web-development as I work on my blog. I&#39;m not actively learning the ins and ou</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.cloudflare.com/containers-are-available-in-public-beta-for-simple-global-and-programmable/&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img&#xA;        src=&#34;https://shots.wayl.one/shot/?url=https://blog.cloudflare.com/containers-are-available-in-public-beta-for-simple-global-and-programmable/&amp;height=450&amp;width=800&amp;scaled_width=800&amp;scaled_height=450&amp;selectors=&#34;&#xA;        alt=&#34;shot of post - Containers are available in public beta for simple, global, and programmable compute&#34;&#xA;        height=450&#xA;        width=800&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here&amp;rsquo;s my thought on &lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.cloudflare.com/containers-are-available-in-public-beta-for-simple-global-and-programmable/&#34;&gt;Containers are available in public beta for simple, global, and programmable compute&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;ve been learning a lot just about basic web-development as I work on my blog. I&amp;rsquo;m not actively learning the ins and outs to be honest - AI is both helpful and harmful in this regard for me I think - but in that knowledge-gathering and experience-gaining I&amp;rsquo;ve gotten my head around deploying a static site to a simple web server and how that&amp;rsquo;s different than deploying a simple container with a backend.&#xA;I use cloudflare for my DNS already, and I have an app or 2 on fly - but depending on the IaC support for container deployment that are now available with cloudflare I may look to switch&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I suppose I should do a little PoC first, and so this thought will be a reminder to take a stab at it&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;admonition note&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;admonition-title&#34;&gt;Note&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This is one of [[ my-thoughts ]]. I picked this up from &lt;a href=&#34;https://waylonwalker.com&#34;&gt;Waylon Walker&lt;/a&gt;(&lt;a href=&#34;https://thoughts.waylonwalker.com&#34;&gt;https://thoughts.waylonwalker.com&lt;/a&gt;). It&amp;rsquo;s a short note that I make about someone else&amp;rsquo;s content online.  Learn more about the process &lt;a href=&#34;/thoughts/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Thoughts&#34; data-description=&#34;My thoughts are found at my thoughts feed&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-06-09&#34; data-preview=&#34;My thoughts are found at my thoughts feed&#34;&gt;Thoughts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;</content>
